Subject: [PATCH] hyprvx: hit-test windows through the camera

Patch 0006 of the HyprVX V3 series (Feature 001, Phase 2, T061).

- src/hyprvx/InputCamera.{hpp,cpp}: screenToWorld / worldToScreen
  (cammath::inverse / forward, monitor chosen by screen position, stock
  path unchanged when no camera applies) and isWindowContent (window-pass
  surfaces vs. layer, lock and IME surfaces).
- windowAt: monitor from the screen position, window boxes and popups
  tested at the world point (FR-007).
- windowSurfaceAt / surfaceLocalAt: surface-local coordinates from the
  world point, so wl_pointer coordinates equal surfaceLocal(S).
---
 src/desktop/state/ViewHitTester.cpp | 16 ++++++---
 src/hyprvx/InputCamera.cpp          | 52 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/hyprvx/InputCamera.hpp          | 29 ++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/hyprvx/InputCamera.cpp
 create mode 100644 src/hyprvx/InputCamera.hpp

